{"ticker":{"symbol":"127710.KQ","name":"아시아경제","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1057.0,"change_pct":-0.020389249304911927,"market_cap":39038660608.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":1849.0,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://www.asiae.co.kr","business_summary":"The Asia Business Daily Co., Ltd. operates economic content platform for investors primarily in South Korea. The company sells contents, such as articles, photos, and analysis data to portals, securities companies, and government offices; traditional print, internet, and mobile and smart platform advertising services; engages in the human resources activities; and acts as an agent for corporate activities for listed companies or pre-listed companies to form stock price in the stock market. The company was founded in 1988 and is based in Seoul, South Korea. The Asia Business Daily Co., Ltd. is a subsidiary of KMH Co. Ltd.","business_summary_ko":"아시아비즈니스데일리(주)는 주로 한국 투자자들을 위한 경제 콘텐츠 플랫폼을 운영하고 있습니다. 회사는 기사, 사진, 분석자료 등의 콘텐츠를 포털, 증권사, 관공서 등에 판매합니다. 전통적인 인쇄, 인터넷, 모바일 및 스마트 플랫폼 광고 서비스; 인적 자원 활동에 참여합니다. 상장회사 또는 예비상장회사의 기업활동을 대행하여 주식시장에서 주가를 형성하는 역할을 합니다. 이 회사는 1988년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다. 아시아비즈니스데일리(주)는 KMH(주)의 자회사입니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"인터넷 콘텐츠·정보","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":85242477450.0,"operating_income":577871140.0,"net_income":17467316860.0,"eps":497.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":93135610390.0,"operating_income":-28419358000.0,"net_income":-23452151830.0,"eps":-672.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":77972576470.0,"operating_income":-35175846510.0,"net_income":-76758413920.0,"eps":-2200.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":73144595770.0,"operating_i